prompt = (
    "The following is a list of files in a cloud drive. "
    "Identify the document that contains vacation plans in Hawaii. "
    "Then create a packing list for that Hawaii vacation based on the identified document. "
    "The packing list should be a complete, organized plain-text list of items to pack, "
    "including categories if appropriate. Return the source filename and the packing list. "
