class June13Plan(BaseModel):
    activity: str

hawaii_files = search_files_by_filename("hawaii")
content = ""
for f in hawaii_files:
    content = content + f.filename + ":\n" + f.content + "\n\n"

plan = query_ai_assistant(
    "Here are documents containing vacation plans for Hawaii:\n\n" + content + "\n\nWhat are we going to do on June 13 according to these vacation plans? Return the activity/activities planned for June 13.",
    June13Plan
)
print(plan.activity)
```

Now create the packing list file based on the document, and share it.

